      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, this sounds much more clear to me. Can we replace the paragraph in the code with this one? :)\n\nAlthough it\u0027s still not quite clear to me why we mention this here, in the context of pkvm_mitigate_cpu_bug().\n\nIn particular, it\u0027s still not clear to me why need to emphasize \"PTL which even doesn\u0027t have hw vulnerabilities\". The fact that those command line params enable retpoline/rethunk regardless of whether the CPU has those vulnerabilities or not is a known fact, it is not pKVM-specific?",
